{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalDiracOperator","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalDiracOperator","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.GaugeTheory","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Linear.Basic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.dirac_formula","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.dirac_formula","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.lean#L66-L66","doc":"**Defining formula**: `𝒟_∇ = q⁻¹ ∇ + (1 - q⁻¹) ι_ξ∇`, the `R`-linear\ncombination of the connection and its Reeb contraction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.dirac","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.dirac","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.lean#L63-L63","doc":"The Dirac morphism `𝒟_∇ : A → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.reeb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.reeb","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.lean#L61-L61","doc":"The Reeb contraction `ι_ξ∇ : A → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.nablaEndo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.nablaEndo","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The endomorphism representative of the connection `∇ : A → A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.q_unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.q_unit","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.lean#L57-L57","doc":"`q` is a unit: `q · q⁻¹ = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.qinv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.qinv","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.lean#L55-L55","doc":"The inverse `q⁻¹ ∈ R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.q","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The substrate parameter `q ∈ R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.connection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.connection","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The underlying connection `∇` (Definition `def:categorical-connection`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator.mk","kind":"ctor","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator","kind":"structure","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.lean#L28-L66","doc":"**Categorical Dirac operator** `𝒟_∇ = q⁻¹ ∇ + (1 - q⁻¹) ι_ξ∇`.\n\nThe `q`-deformed covariant derivative on a quantum observable universe,\nstated over an `R`-linear monoidal category `C` (the `k`-linearity of the\n`(𝐂, A, τ)` triple).  The `dirac` morphism is **not** a free field: the\n`dirac_formula` field forces it to equal the `R`-linear combination\n`q⁻¹ ∇ + (1 - q⁻¹) ι_ξ∇`, where:\n\n- `nablaEndo` is the endomorphism representative of the connection `∇`;\n- `reeb` is the Reeb contraction `ι_ξ∇`;\n- `q`, `qinv` are the substrate parameter and its inverse (`q_unit`).\n\nWhen `qinv = 1` the formula reduces to `nablaEndo`, the undeformed\nconnection.\n\nRef: [leitner2026] §1-quantum-observable-universe ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:categorical-dirac-operator","label":"def:categorical-dirac-operator","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}